      "content": "# MaryRuth Organics — 3-in-1 Daily Women’s Health Capsules\n\n**Source:** https://www.maryruthorganics.com/products/3-in-1-womens-daily-health-capsules  \n**Product:** 3-in-1 Daily Women’s Health Capsules  \n**Status:** Best seller  \n**Reviews:** 113 reviews; **4.61/5 average rating**  \n**Main positioning:** Women’s daily prebiotic, probiotic, and postbiotic capsules for gut, vaginal, immune, hormone, mood, and microbiome support.\n\n---\n\n## Key Product Summary\n\nMaryRuth Organics’ **3-in-1 Daily Women’s Health Capsules** are **unflavored vegan capsules** formulated for **adults 18+**. Each serving provides a **probiotic and postbiotic blend with 50 billion CFU** and a **23-strain blend of probiotic and postbiotic microbes**, designed specifically for a woman’s microbiome.\n\n> **“Support your gut health, vaginal health, and microbiome balance with these 3-in-1 pre-, pro-, and postbiotic capsules with strains for a woman’s unique microbiome!”**\n\n","at":1778879419.889238},{"name":"dtc_site_search_record","tool_call_id":"call_8qNiKtb4a273aBYTRc3JSR2R","args":{"site_url":"maryruthorganics.com","sku_id":"1729918720723358670","success":true,"exploration_summary":"Looked up TikTok SKU; no generated tool or skill available for maryruthorganics.com, so browsed the site directly. Used the site's search dialog for "3-in-1 Daily Women's Health Capsules" and found 4 results. The top result was the exact product, verified by extracting its product page details: same title, 30 ct size, vegan capsules, 50 billion CFU, 23-strain pre/pro/postbiotic blend, women's gut/vaginal/hormone/microbiome support.","successful_steps":"1. tiktok_sku_lookup(1729918720723358670) returned title and description for MaryRuth's 3-in-1 Daily Women's Health Capsules, 50 Billion CFU, 30 ct. 2. dtc_site_search_context(maryruthorganics.com) returned has_tool=false and has_skill=false. 3. Navigated to https://maryruthorganics.com (redirected to https://www.maryruthorganics.com/). 4. Opened site search and searched for "3-in-1 Daily Women's Health Capsules". 5. Search results showed top result "3-in-1 Daily Women's Health Capsules". 6. Extracted/verifed product page https://www.maryruthorganics.com/products/3-in-1-womens-daily-health-capsules.","pitfalls":["Search is powered by Klevu; product result links may not expose all details in the accessibility snapshot, so use DOM href extraction or product page extraction to confirm URL/details.","No TikTok-side images were available, so visual comparison was skipped."],"product_urls":["https://www.maryruthorganics.com/products/3-in-1-womens-daily-health-capsules"],"candidate_products":[{"title":"3-in-1 Daily Women’s Health Capsules","url":"https://www.maryruthorganics.com/products/3-in-1-womens-daily-health-capsules","evidence":"Exact title match to SKU; product page lists 30 ct, vegan capsules, 50 billion CFU per serving, 23-strain probiotic/postbiotic microbial blend, pre/pro/postbiotic women's microbiome support for gut, vaginal, immune and hormone balance."}],"route_used":"direct_browser","tool_success":false},"preview":"{"success": true, "message": "DTC site exploration recorded; background cleanup started.", "site_url": "https://maryruthorganics.com", "site_key": "maryruthorganics-com-ed643cebcf8a", "record_id": "20260515T211031Z-d993a8b2", "raw_path": "/mnt/bn/zhangwendong-nas06/YujunSun/hermes-agent/dtc_site_search_data/maryruthorganics-com-ed643cebcf8a/raw/20260515T211031Z-d993a8b2.json", "skill_name": "dtc-site-maryruthorganics-com-ed643cebcf8a"}","at":1778879431.4735284}]}

